{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M1bMezrWaBfDKurH9BcnF1","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Nov  2 08:39 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Nov  2 08:39 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 2007 Nov  2 08:39 01-movie-list.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 2045 Nov  2 08:39 02-auditorium-map.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1842 Nov  2 08:39 03-seat-selection.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1953 Nov  2 08:39 04-booking-summary.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 2048 Nov  2 08:39 05-checkout.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1075 Nov  2 08:39 06-confirmation.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  402 Nov  2 08:39 07-final-pass.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  877 Nov  2 08:39 README.md\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.json\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.spec.json\napps/cinescope/project.json\napps/cinescope/eslint.config.mjs\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.app.json\napps/cinescope/src/styles.scss\napps/cinescope/src/main.ts\napps/cinescope/src/index.html\napps/cinescope/public/favicon.ico\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\n{\n  \"name\": \"cinescope\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@11.1.0\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26.5.0\",\n    \"pnpm\": \">=11.1.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"api\": \"json-s