{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WtKX8DX7Zv5CSqupNcZrCr","type":"tool_result","content":"494:### 9.3 Summary\n495-\n496-| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n497-|---|---|---|\n498-| `summary-title` | the `Your tickets` title | — |\n499-| `summary-list` | container of the summary items | — |\n500-| `summary-item` | one summary item | — |\n501-| `summary-item-title` | movie title in an item | — |\n502-| `summary-item-datetime` | date and time in an item | — |\n503-| `summary-item-row` | row number in an item | — |\n504-| `summary-item-seat` | seat description in an item | — |\n505-| `summary-item-price` | price in an item | — |\n506-| `summary-item-remove-button` | `Remove` in an item | — |\n507-| `summary-total` | the `Total: … PLN` line | — |\n508-| `back-button` | `Back` | — |\n509-| `confirm-button` | `Confirm` | — |\n510-\n511-### 9.4 Checkout\n512-\n513-| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n514-|---|---|---|\n515-| `checkout-title` | the `Your details` title | — |\n516-| `first-name-input` | first name field | — |\n517-| `last-name-input` | last name field | — |\n518-| `email-input` | email field | — |\n519-| `confirm-email-input` | confirm email field | — |\n--\n646:- **AC-67** — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n647-\n648-### Checkout\n649-- **AC-41** — The form renders first name, last name, email, confirm email, phone number and a terms checkbox.\n650-- **AC-42** — First name and last name are required and must be at least 2 characters.\n651-- **AC-43** — Email is required and must be a valid address; confirm email must match it.\n652-- **AC-44** — Phone number is optional; when filled it must be exactly 9 digits.\n653-- **AC-45** — The terms checkbox is required.\n654-- **AC-46** — The pay button is enabled whenever no payment request is in flight; clicking it on an invalid form marks all fields as touched, shows the messages and shows the toast `The form contains errors`, without navigating.\n655-- **AC-47** — The pay button on a valid form sends `POST /reservations`, is disabled while the request is in flight, navigates to `/confirmation` on success, and on failure stays on the form and shows the toast `Payment failed. Please try again.`\n656-- **AC-61** — The checkout shows the title `Your details`.\n657-- **AC-62** — The pay button reads `Pay <total> PLN`, the total of the booking.\n658-- **AC-63** — `Back` on the checkout returns to the summary with the booking intact.\n659-- **AC-64** — The checkout values survive going back to the summary and forward again, and a page reload; a new booking starts with an empty form.\n660-- **AC-65** — The labels of the five required fields end with `*`; the phone label does not.\n661-- **AC-68** — Every checkout identifier in section 9.4 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n662-\n663-### Confirmation and booking\n664-- **AC-48** — `/confirmation` shows `Payment successful` and `Your tickets will be sent shortly to <email>`; `Continue` navigates to `/` and clears the booking; the booking survives a reload via `sessionStorage`; entering the summary, checkout or confirmation without a matching booking redirects to `/`.\n665-- **AC-69** — Every confirmation identifier in section 9.5 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n666-\n667----\n668-\n669-## 11. Out of scope\n670-\n671-Do not build any of these: user accounts, real payment processing, seat locking between\n---\nexport interface Movie {\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  genre: string;\n  runtimeMinutes: number;\n  format: 'PL dubbing' | 'PL subtitles';\n}\n\nexport interface Screening {\n  id: number;\n  movieId: number;\n  date: string;\n  time: string;\n  occupiedSeats: string[];\n}\n\nexport interface CustomerDetails {\n  firstName: string;\n  lastName: string;\n  email: string;\n  phone: string;\n}\n\nexport interface NewReservation {\n  screeningId: number;\n  seats: string[];\n  customer: CustomerDetails;\n  totalPrice: number;\n}\n\nexport interface Reservation extends NewReservation {\n  id: number;\n}\n---\nhttp://localhost:3000/movies 200\nhttp://localhost:4200/ 200\nhttp://127.0.0.1:9444/json/version 200","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5dce9b95-c95f-42d9-ad14-7fe0b1984c4e","uuid":"812822e1-800d-40d2-958d-98cb10deb1ae","timestamp":"2026-11-03T15:50:54.607Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"494:### 9.3 Summary\n495-\n496-| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n497-|---|---|---|\n498-| `summary-title` | the `Your tickets` title | — |\n499-| `summary-list` | container of the summary items | — |\n500-| `summary-item` | one summary item | — |\n501-| `summary-item-title` | movie title in an item | — |\n502-| `summary-item-datetime` | date and time in an item | — |\n503-| `summary-item-row` | row number in an item | — |\n504-| `summary-item-seat` | seat description in an item | — |\n505-| `summary-item-price` | price in an item | — |\n506-| `summary-item-remove-button` | `Remove` in an item | — |\n507-| `summary-total` | the `Total: … PLN` line | — |\n508-| `back-button` | `Back` | — |\n509-| `confirm-button` | `Confirm` | — |\n510-\n511-### 9.4 Checkout\n512-\n513-| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n514-|---|---|---|\n515-| `checkout-title` | the `Your details` title | — |\n516-| `first-name-input` | first name field | — |\n517-| `last-name-input` | last name field | — |\n518-| `email-input` | email field | — |\n519-| `confirm-email-input` | confirm email field | — |\n--\n646:- **AC-67** — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n647-\n648-### Checkout\n649-- **AC-41** — The form renders first name, last name, email, confirm email, phone number and a terms checkbox.\n650-- **AC-42** — First name and last name are required and must be at least 2 characters.\n651-- **AC-43** — Email is required and must be a valid address;